title: "Automated Experimentation Platform"
abstract: >-
  Open-source control software for an automated materials-synthesis platform:
  JSON-defined experimental flows executed on robot arms with electronic
  pipettes, an electronic balance, hot-plate stirrers, cameras and IoT sensors.
